OL,3,GNEWSASaxon woman's gold pendant found
OL,4,Aby detectorist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "top-notch" gold pendant once owned
OL,7,Fby a Christian woman at the end of the
OL,8,F7th Century has been found by a
OL,9,Fdetectorist.
OL,11,FThe discovery was made in February last
OL,12,Fyear at Martham, near Great Yarmouth,
OL,13,Fand it is now going through the
OL,14,Ftreasure process.
OL,16,FNorfolk finds liaison officer Dr Helen
OL,17,FGeake said the artefact was "very
OL,18,Fskilfully" made, with three types of
OL,19,Fgold filigree work, a red stone in the
OL,20,Fmiddle of a cross design and gold
OL,21,Fbosses in each quarter section.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
