OL,3,GNEWSASaxon woman's gold pendant found
OL,4,Aby detectorist
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Its suspension loop is worn and some
OL,7,Fof the beads are worn flat where it was
OL,8,Frubbed by fingers or against clothes -
OL,9,Fthe owner must have worn it daily," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
